-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ד/6 — "העסקה קבלנית" של עובדי הוראה במערכת החינוך (6.4.2014)
-- A cover note: it announces the Director-General's instructions on
-- contractor employment of teaching staff and links to them. The
-- instructions themselves are in the linked document, not in this text.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ד/6 העסקה קבלנית`

-- akn:preamble/p1 Letterhead: State of Israel; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 Letterhead: Ministry of Education; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 Letterhead: teaching staff administration; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 Letterhead: senior division for teaching personnel; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The circular's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The circular's date, 6.4.2014; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p1 Announces that the Director-General's instructions on contractor employment follow; the instructions are not in this text (see p8), so it sets no rule here.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 A link to the instructions as a separate document (meyda.education.gov.il haasaka_kablanit.pdf); the text published here carries none of them.

§§ `Property checks`

-- The cover note sets no rule, so there is no space to check: it carries no
-- amount, condition or duty, and its every row is accounted for above as a
-- row that carries none.
`the rules this cover note sets` MEANS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the rules this cover note sets` EQUALS EMPTY
